International bodies all raised Korea’s
2026 growth outlook: IMF from 1.

27
00:01:47,654 --> 00:01:52,442
9% to 2. 6%, OECD from 2. 6% to
3. 7%, ADB from 2. 6% to 3. 2%.

28
00:01:52,482 --> 00:01:55,204
Chip and AI exports drive the gains,

29
