but all three say the boom is not yet
feeding household spending or services.

30
00:02:01,153 --> 00:02:05,407
The IMF warned of downside
risks “proportional to gains”

31
00:02:05,447 --> 00:02:10,585
if the AI investment cycle turns;
the OECD sees inflation at 3. 0%.

32
00:02:11,785 --> 00:02:17,979
Yeo Seo-jeong’s golden landing after 8
years; K-4 kayak beats China by 0. 255s.

33
00:02:18,019 --> 00:02:24,292
Korea won two golds on the first day of
Chuseok at the Aichi-Nagoya Asian Games.

34
